4.0+, bridge protocol 1 and MLX 0.32.2. No model weights included. Restart Desktop after installing the engine update.\n\nSource: [71588ab9c758](https://github.com/0xZKnw/mlxl3/commit/71588ab9c758ad95bb6b0041bed6c061fb7a70c7). Four CI jobs passed, with independent physical checks of 12 bit-exact checkpoint positions and 36 signed-engine MTP bridge cases.\n\nArchive: 66,866,870 bytes. SHA-256: `e220ae2e4fccae7515f9601a49ec0007730798cf2bf764177de96a09a3a81d0b`.\n"}